---
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px 22px; align-items: center; font-size: 14px; color: #C9C8D8">
<span style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="16" height="16"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="7" fill="#3CA8E4" stroke="#0A0A12"></circle></svg>Defending team</span>
<span style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="16" height="16"><circle cx="8" cy="8" r="7" fill="#F4F3F8" stroke="#0A0A12"></circle></svg>Attacking team</span>
<span style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="12" height="12"><circle cx="6" cy="6" r="5" fill="#F5D90A" stroke="#0A0A12"></circle></svg>Ball</span>
<span style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="22" height="14"><path d="M21 1 A12 12 0 0 0 21 13 Z" fill="rgba(249,14,231,0.3)" stroke="#F90EE7" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-dasharray="3 2"></path></svg>Goal Zone</span>
<span style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="18" height="14"><line x1="1" y1="1" x2="1" y2="13" stroke="#4E7F66" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="3 3"></line></svg>Halfway line</span>
</div>
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(300px, 100%), 1fr)); gap: 16px">
