<rect x="4" y="4" width="392" height="232" rx="18" fill="none" stroke="#2D5A44" stroke-width="6"></rect>
<line x1="12" y1="10" x2="12" y2="230" stroke="#4E7F66" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="6 6"></line>
<path d="M388 62 A58 58 0 0 0 388 178 Z" fill="rgba(249,14,231,0.22)" stroke="#F90EE7" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-dasharray="7 5"></path>
<rect x="388" y="95" width="8" height="50" fill="#F4F3F8"></rect>
<circle cx="236" cy="172" r="11" fill="#F4F3F8" stroke="#0A0A12" stroke-width="2"></circle><circle cx="220" cy="70" r="11" fill="#F4F3F8" stroke="#0A0A12" stroke-width="2"></circle><circle cx="250" cy="166" r="5.5" fill="#F5D90A" stroke="#0A0A12" stroke-width="1.5"></circle><line x1="256" y1="163" x2="287.7" y2="144.1" stroke="#F5D90A" stroke-width="2.5"></line><path d="M298 138 L284.6 139.0 L290.8 149.3 Z" fill="#F5D90A"></path><circle cx="312" cy="130" r="11" fill="#3CA8E4" stroke="#0A0A12" stroke-width="2"></circle><circle cx="312" cy="130" r="17" fill="none" stroke="#3CA8E4" stroke-width="3"></circle><circle cx="290" cy="70" r="11" fill="#3CA8E4" stroke="#0A0A12" stroke-width="2"></circle>
</svg>
<figcaption style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px">
<span style="display: inline-flex; align-self: flex-start; align-items: center; gap: 6px; background: #3CA8E4; color: #0A0A12; font-weight: 800; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 5px 12px 5px 8px; border-radius: 999px"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#0A0A12" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="5 12 10 17 19 7"></polyline></svg>Legal</span>
<span style="font-family: 'Archivo Black', sans-serif; font-size: 20px; color: #F4F3F8">Blocking a shot from outside</span>
<span style="color: #C9C8D8; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5">A defender steps into the shooting lane and blocks with their body, standing outside the zone. Legal.</span>
<span style="color: #3CA8E4; font-weight: 800; font-size: 14px">Play on</span>
</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure style="margin: 0; border: 2px solid #FF6B6B; border-radius: 18px; padding: 16px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; background: #0F0F19">
<svg role="img" aria-label="Defending from inside the zone: Not legal" viewBox="0 0 400 240" style="width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; background: #0E2A1C; border-radius: 14px">
<rect x="4" y="4" width="392" height="232" rx="18" fill="none" stroke="#2D5A44" stroke-width="6"></rect>
<line x1="12" y1="10" x2="12" y2="230" stroke="#4E7F66" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="6 6"></line>
<path d="M388 62 A58 58 0 0 0 388 178 Z" fill="rgba(249,14,231,0.22)" stroke="#F90EE7" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-dasharray="7 5"></path>
<rect x="388" y="95" width="8" height="50" fill="#F4F3F8"></rect>
<circle cx="240" cy="108" r="11" fill="#F4F3F8" stroke="#0A0A12" stroke-width="2"></circle><circle cx="252" cy="112" r="5.5" fill="#F5D90A" stroke="#0A0A12" stroke-width="1.5"></circle><circle cx="250" cy="180" r="11" fill="#F4F3F8" stroke="#0A0A12" stroke-width="2"></circle><circle cx="372" cy="120" r="11" fill="#3CA8E4" stroke="#0A0A12" stroke-width="2"></circle><circle cx="372" cy="120" r="17" fill="none" stroke="#FF6B6B" stroke-width="3"></circle><circle cx="296" cy="150" r="11" fill="#3CA8E4" stroke="#0A0A12" stroke-width="2"></circle>
</svg>
<figcaption style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px">
<span style="display: inline-flex; align-self: flex-start; align-items: center; gap: 6px; background: #FF6B6B; color: #0A0A12; font-weight: 800; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 5px 12px 5px 8px; border-radius: 999px"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#0A0A12" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"></line><line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"></line></svg>Not legal</span>
<span style="font-family: 'Archivo Black', sans-serif; font-size: 20px; color: #F4F3F8">Defending from inside the zone</span>
<span style="color: #C9C8D8; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5">A defender stands in the zone to guard the goal. The zone is off limits to everyone.</span>
<span style="color: #FF6B6B; font-weight: 800; font-size: 14px">Free kick at the top of the zone + team foul</span>
</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure style="margin: 0; border: 2px solid #FF6B6B; border-radius: 18px; padding: 16px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; background: #0F0F19">
<svg role="img" aria-label="Attacking from inside the zone: Not legal" viewBox="0 0 400 240" style="width: 100%; height: auto; display: block; background: #0E2A1C; border-radius: 14px">
<rect x="4" y="4" width="392" height="232" rx="18" fill="none" stroke="#2D5A44" stroke-width="6"></rect>
<line x1="12" y1="10" x2="12" y2="230" stroke="#4E7F66" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="6 6"></line>
<path d="M388 62 A58 58 0 0 0 388 178 Z" fill="rgba(249,14,231,0.22)" stroke="#F90EE7" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-dasharray="7 5"></path>
<rect x="388" y="95" width="8" height="50" fill="#F4F3F8"></rect>
<circle cx="300" cy="152" r="11" fill="#3CA8E4" stroke="#0A0A12" stroke-width="2"></circle><circle cx="268" cy="76" r="11" fill="#3CA8E4" stroke="#0A0A12" stroke-width="2"></circle><circle cx="362" cy="104" r="11" fill="#F4F3F8" stroke="#0A0A12" stroke-width="2"></circle><circle cx="362" cy="104" r="17" fill="none" stroke="#FF6B6B" stroke-width="3"></circle><circle cx="372" cy="112" r="5.5" fill="#F5D90A" stroke="#0A0A12" stroke-width="1.5"></circle><circle cx="230" cy="128" r="11" fill="#F4F3F8" stroke="#0A0A12" stroke-width="2"></circle>
</svg>
<figcaption style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px">
<span style="display: inline-flex; align-self: flex-start; align-items: center; gap: 6px; background: #FF6B6B; color: #0A0A12; font-weight: 800; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; padding: 5px 12px 5px 8px; border-radius: 999px"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#0A0A12" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"><line x1="6" y1="6" x2="18" y2="18"></line><line x1="18" y1="6" x2="6" y2="18"></line></svg>Not legal</span>
<span style="font-family: 'Archivo Black', sans-serif; font-size: 20px; color: #F4F3F8">Attacking from inside the zone</span>
<span style="color: #C9C8D8; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.5">An attacker dribbles into the zone and shoots. The zone is off limits to both teams, so there is nowhere to hide from a marker.</span>
<span style="color: #FF6B6B; font-weight: 800; font-size: 14px">No goal. Free kick for the defense + team foul.</span>
</figcaption>
</figure>
</div>
